><li>Intel 82599 X520 Chipset: Delivers optimized performance with minimal latency, offering top-tier throughput and reliability for critical applications.</li><li>Low Latency &amp; High Throughput: Perfect for tasks like virtualization, cloud computing, big data, and high-performance storage systems.</li><li>Compatibility &amp; Flexibility: Fully compatible with a wide range of servers and networking environments, making it a versatile choice for any high-demand setup.</li><li>Advanced Networking Features: Supports TCP offload, Jumbo Frames, VLAN tagging, and more to improve network efficiency and reduce server CPU load.</li><li>Energy Efficient: Designed to offer high performance without compromising on power consumption, making it a sustainable solution for modern networks.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/mellanox-cx4121a-acat-cx4-10g25g-sfp28-ethernet-network-card\">Mellanox CX4121A-ACAT CX4 10G/25G SFP28 Ethernet Network&nbsp;Card</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatib